+/*
+ * Budget charge floor for the TB being translated (0 = charge what it holds).
+ *
+ * ☠ The interleave is calibrated against the budget as the STOCK I/O split
+ * path charged it: a TB whose middle insn does MMIO was charged in full at
+ * entry, then the access ran in an uncounted 1-insn CF_NOIRQ TB, then the
+ * suffix TB was charged again. 0017 caps such TBs at the access (for speed)
+ * and so counted exactly — which moved the effective ColdFire:DSP ratio and
+ * made every 8th trig of a FLEX slice go silent (the same failure
+ * --interleave 1024 produces on stock accounting). tb_gen_code sets this to
+ * the uncapped TB's length for a capped TB, so the charge is unchanged.
+ */
+extern int ot_insn_charge_min;
+
 #endif
